type: dataset
title: "Settled model predictions dataset: pre-match 1X2 probabilities and results"
authors:
  - name: "Football Analytics"
    website: "https://footballanalytics.pro"
url: "https://footballanalytics.pro/data"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24216824
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - football
  - soccer
  - match prediction
  - probabilistic forecasting
  - calibration
  - Dixon-Coles
abstract: >-
  For every finished match in the covered competitions: the 1X2 probabilities
  a Dixon-Coles / Poisson model stored before kick-off, its goal expectations,
  its pick and the final score. Nothing is filtered by outcome.
